A collaboration event between [[Nyanko Daisensou]] and the RPG game known as '''Cat Busters''' (キャットバスターズ Kyattobasutāzu) was held from December 1st, 2016 to December 12th, 2016. The collaboration includes  an exclusive stage going on during the collab period. The game is published by Happy Elements K.K<ref>https://www.happyelements.co.jp/</ref>. For more information, see their management page <ref>https://catbus.happyelements.co.jp/</ref>.

==Event Information==
キャッ飛ばしRPG{{Color|#FF0000|'''『キャットバスターズ』'''}}と『にゃんこ大戦争』のコラボイベント開催！<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''開催期間は2016年12月1日(11:00)から12月12日(10:59)予定！'''}}

